## ITACA gas volume, final configuration of 2026-11-15 (config/itaca.toml):
## radius 180 cm, length 130 cm, enriched xenon with 15% helium (mole
## fraction) at 16 bar and 290 K. Step limit 1 mm, as in the NextPrecdr files
## of July 2025.
